Monument to America. 25LSO-0194, 1.0
FISCAL NOTE
This bill contains an appropriation of $40,000 from the GENERAL FUND to the
Legislative Service Office. This appropriation is effective immediately.
This bill contains an appropriation of $40,000 from the GENERAL FUND to the
Governor's Office. This appropriation is effective immediately.
DETAIL OF APPROPRIATION
Agency #: 201 Agency Name: Legislative Service Office
Unit: 0101 Administration
EXPENDITURE BY SERIES AND YEAR FY 2025 FY 2026 FY 2027
0100 Personnel/Benefit Costs $1,500 $5,800 $5,800
0200 Supportive Services Costs $2,700 $11,000 $11,000
Total Expenditure Per Year: $4,200 $16,800 $16,800
Grand Total Expenditure: $37,800
Total Appropriated to Agency: $40,000
Total Appropriated by Fund:
GENERAL FUND $40,000
Description of appropriation:
This appropriation would be expended for the payment of salary, per diem and
mileage for the two legislators appointed to the task force. The above estimate
assumes one meeting in FY 2025, four meetings in FY 2026 and four meetings in FY
2027. If there are no meetings after task force recommendations by July 4, 2026,
there would be no expenditures in FY 2027.
DETAIL OF APPROPRIATION
Agency #: 001 Agency Name: Governor's Office
Unit: 0125 Governor's Office Task Forces
EXPENDITURE BY SERIES AND YEAR FY 2025 FY 2026 FY 2027
0100 Personnel/Benefit Costs $450 $1,800 $1,800
0200 Supportive Services Costs $3,994 $15,980 $15,976
Total Expenditure Per Year: $4,444 $17,780 $17,776
Grand Total Expenditure: $40,000
Total Appropriated to Agency: $40,000
Total Appropriated by Fund:
GENERAL FUND $40,000
Description of appropriation:
The appropriation would be expended for compensation, mileage and per diem for
nonlegislative members of the task force. The above estimates assume one meeting
per quarter. If there are no meetings after task force recommendations by July 4,
2026, there would be no expenditures in FY 2027.
